  <jpcrp030000-asr_E04273-000:NotesChangesInAccountingPoliciesNAFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（会計方針の変更）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp030000-asr_E04273-000:NotesChangesInAccountingPoliciesNAFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesChangesInPresentationFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
